[{"client_msg_id":"aa7b3db0-02f9-4a1a-9c7f-b32002034f5f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"寿湯の水風呂4人くらいは余裕で入れる。そして2つある。","ts":"1631798935.142100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j0k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c55aa03e-c386-4933-a796-c9b37ace9afe","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"KoRoN さんはそんな気がしてました。水風呂は狭いので待ちが発生しているとそこそこで出ます。","ts":"1631794060.141000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=Wiz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8a51007-45fe-44d8-a5db-74e304941ad1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕は水風呂では可能な限り体温を下げる派。だいたい水風呂の主と化す。","ts":"1631793883.140000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nJL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A971C9B6-D6BA-4F30-A37F-0CD65D67283A","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"水風呂は血管の収縮を感じたら出るので私は結構短いです。体温は全然下がらない感じ","ts":"1631791636.139200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Ab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e1963c3-ddbe-4ac2-8223-869ebbb9672c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"どういう順序でどの程度がいいかも難しいですね...","ts":"1631791073.138100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kSCku"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e2d3fdc-5e83-4b14-960b-91f72b6d8083","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"水風呂後に外気浴は寒いのでしないんです。冷やしすぎなのかも。\n運動でも負担はかかるので、そこは自分で調節しようというところでは。（生きるのは体に負担がかかる）","ts":"1631790976.137400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X+pX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab02ea30-8042-41b4-89f5-df3e113dc435","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"（それはそう）","ts":"1631790539.135300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kv4O7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe8a4038-05b2-47b3-8c20-3134e4cb39ef","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちゃんと負担を考えながらやらないとですね\nまあ普通に風呂だってそうなんですが","ts":"1631790539.135200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rcJg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"852953f9-e778-4fc3-b052-a75224a4a5a8","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"「ととのい」は「訪れ」るのか。日本語面白い","ts":"1631790527.134800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nYF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc741896-4925-43c8-8e69-1c7503c97993","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実際どうかはわからないけど、サウナと水風呂を何度も行き来するのは普通に体に負担がかかるのでよくないみたいな話を以前 Twitter で見た (Twitter で見た情報なのでどこまで信用できるのかとかは私にはわからない)","ts":"1631790516.134400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5B6w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EAB0B832-C766-4076-B786-B45EF8433CDE","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"私は外気浴中に訪れますが、もしかしたら個人差があるのかも","ts":"1631790461.133200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nCY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2f0dadc-83a2-4241-89e1-b6ebdc5ec636","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"「空からこぼれたSTORY 」っぽい。\n水風呂→風呂 でジンジンあったまるのが気持ち良いので、そういうことにしておこう。","ts":"1631790222.131900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z76hg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f45db1fc-ed3e-4ade-8adb-011d5da3600c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"サウナ \u0026lt;-\u0026gt; 冷水浴 \u0026lt;-\u0026gt; 外気浴をうまく繰り返すとなるそうだけど、どのタイミングなんだろね\nでもさすがにサウナのタイミングじゃないんだろうけど","ts":"1631790108.130200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6vyB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A8E97BA5-0745-4A85-B4CA-1010D008FEE2","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ととのいは気持ち良さに包み込まれる感じですね","ts":"1631789939.129000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zNsP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"336a7550-ce4d-479b-8b67-13741547e1e9","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"やってみてもわからないんですが、水風呂のタイミングでは訪れないっぽい？","ts":"1631789625.128300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HkG3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78d47689-e2ff-408b-b9a0-963fc5b466e5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"やってみれば分かるらしい。。（私もわからない）","ts":"1631789494.127500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N64"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53e11ba6-54f8-4c82-91bf-71dfca6263fb","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"はい、それはわかるのですが、どんな感覚を「ととのう」というのかわかってないです。","ts":"1631788918.127100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5EF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0a65074-6f0e-45a6-9c17-ffe52e32bbea","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ととのうはサウナ用語？ですよね","ts":"1631788861.126400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2VG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17a0594e-96a7-4fe2-a198-72a6e590baad","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"整うというのがまだわかっていないのですが、そうなのかな？","ts":"1631788809.126100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F4hM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae203334-d7bb-4089-8620-6497c98b1cf0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ととのう？","ts":"1631787534.125200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe472d19-7b2f-4029-b7db-8c88043ace09","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"そんなことありませんか？ \u003chttps://twitter.com/h0k0r0bi/statuses/1438444841168429061\u003e","ts":"1631786974.124800","attachment